text.en:
Section 7 of Republic Act No. 8983, otherwise known as the "Charter of the City of Bayawan", is hereby amended to read as follows:
"Sec. 7. The Officials of the City of Bayawan. -(a) There shall be in the City: a city mayor, a city vice mayor, sangguniang panlungsod members, a secretary to the sangguniang panlungsod, a city treasurer and an assistant city treasurer, a city assessor and an assistant city assessor, a city accountant, a city budget officer, a city planning and development coordinator, a city engineer, a city health officer, a city civil registrar, a city administrator and an assistant city administrator, a city legal officer, a city social welfare and development officer, a city veterinarian, a city general services officer, a city agriculturist, a city cooperatives officer, a city register of deeds, and an environment and natural resources officer;
"(b) x x x "(c) x x x "(d) x x x."
